{"id":"en_serpent-garden-my-sister-s-forbbiden-desire","title":"Serpent Garden：My sister's Forbbiden desire","titleEn":"Serpent Garden：My sister's Forbbiden desire","description":"Antaŭ dek jaroj, Sadie ricevis malpermeson eniri la Serpentan Ĝardenon de sia fratino Lamia, pri kiu onidire okazas sekretaj ritualoj kapablaj transformi la virinajn gastojn. Nun ĉiu koramiko, kiun Sadie hejmen kondukas, estas sekrete delogata de Lamia kaj allogata en la ĝardenon, poste malaperas. Kiam eĉ ŝia fortika nova koramiko Vincent malaperas, Sadie alfrontas Lamian kaj fine paŝas en la malpermesitan ĝardenon. La serion eblas sekvi ĉe Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/serpent-gardenmy-sisters-forbbiden-desire/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/serpent-gardenmy-sisters-forbbiden-desire/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Mystery","Plot Twist","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlxy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_serpent-garden-my-sister-s-forbbiden-desire_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlxy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_serpent-garden-my-sister-s-forbbiden-desire_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlxy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_serpent-garden-my-sister-s-forbbiden-desire_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlxy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_serpent-garden-my-sister-s-forbbiden-desire_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rum